 RFSW RADCOD RAD  FLUC  INTRA POL   COD  DAPER EMIOU K64   FOURI SMEAR
   F     F     F     T     F     F     T     F     F     T     F     T
 $FORM="15.10";
 USE RING;
Out[1]:= USE
 CELL;
 CALC;
 Matched. (  0.000    ) DP = 0.01000  DP0 = 0.00000  ExponentOfResidual = 2.0  OffMomentumWeight =   1.000  CALEXP  
